              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 8:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Basi Sauli akajigeuza, na kuvaa mavazi mengine, kisha akaenda, yeye pamoja na watu wawili wakamfikia yule mwanamke usiku; akasema, Tafadhali unibashirie kwa utambuzi, ukaniletee yeye nitakayemtaja kwako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yule mwanamke akamwambia, Angalia, unajua alivyofanya Sauli, jinsi alivyowakatilia mbali hao wenye pepo wa utambuzi na wachawi katika nchi; mbona basi wanitegea tanzi uhai wangu, ili kuniua? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Sauli akamwapia kwa BWANA, akasema, Aishivyo BWANA, haitakupata adhabu yoyote kwa jambo hili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo yule mwanamke aliposema, Je! Ni nani nitakayekuletea? Naye akasema, Niletee Samweli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
