                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ndipo Samweli akamwambia Sauli, Mbona umenitaabisha mimi, hata kunipandisha juu? Sauli akajibu, Mimi nimetaabika sana; kwa kuwa hao Wafilisti wananifanyia vita, naye Mungu ameniacha; hanijibu tena, wala kwa manabii, wala kwa ndoto; kwa hiyo nimekuita wewe, ili wewe unijulishe nifanyeje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
