        },
        {
          "text": " Ndipo yule mwanamke akamwendea Sauli na alipoona kuwa yeye ametaabika sana, akamwambia, Angalia, mjakazi wako ameisikiliza sauti yako, nami nimehatarisha uhai wangu, nami nimeyasikiliza maneno yako uliyoniambia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
